ltarune.wiki/w/Darkners)に似てきて、深い影はすでに闇の世界の明るい色に変わり始めているかもしれない。おそらく[Titans](https://deltarune.wiki/w/Titans)の目が漆黒の闇を通して白く輝くかもしれない。\n\nもし可能なら、イラストは16:9にしてほしい。\n(DELTARUNEに出てくるものの和名がわからないので、リンクを貼っておきます)", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@sakuyabm/works/13", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 3374259, "client_id": 670645, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/eb81fae4/uploads/origins/c5ede168-3feb-4ebe-8f07-6a54dec26596?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a6837715a24d2adb5fa9dc564a22180d", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/eb81fae4/uploads/origins/c5ede168-3feb-4ebe-8f07-6a54dec26596?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a6837715a24d2adb5fa9dc564a22180d, https://si.imgix.net/eb81fae4/uploads/origins/c5ede168-3feb-4ebe-8f07-6a54dec26596?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d61ba64318d9dcedda00d23eb6c7ed3c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/eb81fae4/uploads/origins/c5ede168-3feb-4ebe-8f07-6a54dec26596?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b1df8841f76f8c94a639213744e19761 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/eb81fae4/uploads/origins/c5ede168-3feb-4ebe-8f07-6a54dec26596?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=afc61c38899f25dcead989063634ef1c", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/eb81fae4/uploads/origins/c5ede168-3feb-4ebe-8f07-6a54dec26596?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=afc61c38899f25dcead989063634ef1c, https://si.imgix.net/eb81fae4/uploads/origins/c5ede168-3feb-4ebe-8f07-6a54dec26596?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=db73c1bb4411d1aaf6ee55fe0c